weaverbird transliterates the PyCuTe modules into Rust. It keeps the
same module split, the same function names, and the same algorithms.
Its test suite is a port of the PyCuTe test suite.

CuTe and CUTLASS are names of NVIDIA Corporation. This project is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by NVIDIA Corporation. It
uses those names only to state what it is a port of.
